  "title": {
    "type": "text",
    "$t": "儀式ê作用"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span><b>作者：</b></span></span><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b>藍春瑞</b></span></p><div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Íng過ê人無讀偌濟冊，mā無啥mih科學觀念來了解天地萬物ê起落變化，見若tn̄g著天災地變、艱難困苦，koh sa bē著tsáng頭、揣無步數thang去對抗ê時tsūn，就隨beh信講有一寡看無、摸無ê神明鬼怪，ē pìnn弄世間人ê禍福、好bái，不時tio̍h-ài lán去kā in thíng-sīng、巴結，tsiah有法度替lán消災解厄、降福hōo眾人。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">若有tsit款講bē出喙--ê拍算tiâu tī心肝頭，就ē beh種作進前先拜土地，五穀收成隨ài謝神，beh出征、拍獵先淨身、祭祖，剉樹仔先拜山神……啥mih穡頭，lóng ài先pìnn一寡抽籤、卜卦、求神、問鬼等等ê齣頭，kan-na一个心願，就是beh消tháu心肝內ê giâu疑kap不安niā-niā，tse正正就是lán人千百款「儀式」上根本ê路用。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">啊若「死--去」tsit款恐怖ê代誌，tsiah是其中上深ê禁忌kap驚惶，無人知影「死」是啥mih碗糕趖，三魂七魄是走去佗--leh？Kám ē變做妖魔鬼怪？Ē出來做惡、害--人--bē？就是tsit个kuà礙tī心肝頭ngiau，就有徛師公壇、做功德、八家將、西天取經、五子哭墓、家祭liam香種種ê儀式，lóng是beh hōo iáu-koh在生ê囝孫序細求一个平靜、心安niā-niā。Iáu有入木進前ê纏白布、結蓮花tsiah落壙，mā是儀式內底ê一種，心理ê作用lóng仝款，上原本ê意義，應該是尊tshûn過往ê親人，表示心肝內ê致重kap m̄甘，ǹg望清氣ê蓮花ē-tàng伴伊ê身魂，一路平安行到極樂西天去做仙。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">M̄管啥mih款ê儀式，lóng ē-tàng教示囝囝孫孫，hōo in知影祖先仔有tsit種舊例kap心意，tī無聲無sueh ê環境內底勻勻仔認同、保存--落-去，ǹg望一代湠過一代，bē kā拍ka-la̍uh--去。&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br /></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">（Tsit篇文章bat刊tī教育部電子報，漢羅用字有調整，原文網址：<a href=\"https://reurl.cc/qLaQ8E\" target=\"_blank\">https://reurl.cc/qLaQ8E</a>）</p><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br /></div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br /></div><span></span><span><a name='more'></a></span><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjJqFCxQZr8w1zoY_IYszgDiCXNCDV-CTYZRGMSTLV4mspusF9f9Kn37MyYdbP0EL9x2kCO98Q9yBWXtct9tJK-8GtG7cX4Iurf-NQXho2yNmQYslXmGCGKXFP30BrEJdAEaujyt0olPXkRRJ2XmFa834QmTAyNcaWLO-2hXK1cEvVazB2W2F5pX2_W8x0d/s3036/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1352%E6%9C%9F_7.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"3036\" data-original-width=\"2150\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjJqFCxQZr8w1zoY_IYszgDiCXNCDV-CTYZRGMSTLV4mspusF9f9Kn37MyYdbP0EL9x2kCO98Q9yBWXtct9tJK-8GtG7cX4Iurf-NQXho2yNmQYslXmGCGKXFP30BrEJdAEaujyt0olPXkRRJ2XmFa834QmTAyNcaWLO-2hXK1cEvVazB2W2F5pX2_W8x0d/w454-h640/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1352%E6%9C%9F_7.jpg\" width=\"454\" /></a></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEh7KktBXByvfbkzqXwi5qWpaYdHPdUNvjyo-a4rWXMgNSTc8hJHn1KXQyXgXlPfh27t3MVmI8KkldN7ZyI9CorNvmON4ONLMERuLGm_AN69QcEgrogASkQ5sNj6OXs4uWxwmCsve7pvu90OK0DS8F-IFaWqohtDQ3YMrQHHR8AbuhOHTuq5sz_EKyUMkyT-/s1424/352%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1_%E5%B0%81%E9%9D%A2.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1424\" data-original-width=\"1000\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEh7KktBXByvfbkzqXwi5qWpaYdHPdUNvjyo-a4rWXMgNSTc8hJHn1KXQyXgXlPfh27t3MVmI8KkldN7ZyI9CorNvmON4ONLMERuLGm_AN69QcEgrogASkQ5sNj6OXs4uWxwmCsve7pvu90OK0DS8F-IFaWqohtDQ3YMrQHHR8AbuhOHTuq5sz_EKyUMkyT-/w450-h640/352%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1_%E5%B0%81%E9%9D%A2.jpg\" width=\"450\" /></a></div><br /><div class=\"separa